{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Built-in presets. Selectors are best effort: sites change their markup, so every preset can be re-tuned in the app (Edit → tap elements on the site). Empty selectors fall back to automatic detection.",
  "adapters": [
    {
      "id": "chatgpt",
      "name": "ChatGPT",
      "kind": "web",
      "group": "ai",
      "domain": "chatgpt.com",
      "url": "https://chatgpt.com/",
      "newChatUrl": "https://chatgpt.com/",
      "color": "#10A37F",
      "icon": "GPT",
      "desktop": false,
      "submit": "auto",
      "selectors": {
        "input": "#prompt-textarea",
        "send": "button[data-testid=\"send-button\"], #composer-submit-button",
        "response": "[data-message-author-role=\"assistant\"]",
        "busy": "button[data-testid=\"stop-button\"]",
        "chatLink": "a[href^=\"/c/\"]",
        "projectLink": "a[href^=\"/g/g-p-\"]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "claude",
      "name": "Claude",
      "kind": "web",
      "group": "ai",
      "domain": "claude.ai",
      "url": "https://claude.ai/new",
      "newChatUrl": "https://claude.ai/new",
      "color": "#D97757",
      "icon": "C",
      "desktop": false,
      "submit": "auto",
      "selectors": {
        "input": "div.ProseMirror[contenteditable=\"true\"]",
        "send": "button[aria-label=\"Send message\"], button[aria-label=\"Send Message\"]",
        "response": "div[data-is-streaming]",
        "busy": "div[data-is-streaming=\"true\"], button[aria-label=\"Stop response\"]",
        "chatLink": "a[href^=\"/chat/\"]",
        "projectLink": "a[href^=\"/project/\"]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "notion",
      "name": "Notion AI",
      "kind": "web",
      "group": "ai",
      "domain": "notion.so",
      "url": "https://www.notion.so/ai",
      "newChatUrl": "https://www.notion.so/ai",
      "color": "#FFFFFF",
      "icon": "N",
      "desktop": true,
      "submit": "auto",
      "note": "Без API-ключа: входите в свой аккаунт Notion прямо в Relay. Если поле ввода не находится — нажмите «Настроить» и тапните его.",
      "selectors": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "hark",
      "name": "Hark Pro",
      "kind": "web",
      "group": "ai",
      "domain": "hark.com",
      "url": "https://hark.com/",
      "newChatUrl": "https://hark.com/",
      "color": "#F5C542",
      "icon": "H",
      "desktop": false,
      "submit": "auto",
      "singleThread": true,
      "singleThreadTitle": "Основной тред Hark",
      "note": "У Hark Pro один общий тред + «Проекты». Relay пишет в основной тред; проекты появятся в списке, если их удастся найти на странице (или укажите селектор проекта).",
      "selectors": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini",
      "name": "Gemini",
      "kind": "web",
      "group": "ai",
      "domain": "gemini.google.com",
      "url": "https://gemini.google.com/app",
      "newChatUrl": "https://gemini.google.com/app",
      "color": "#4C8DF6",
      "icon": "G",
      "desktop": false,
      "submit": "auto",
      "note": "Google может не пускать вход внутри встроенного браузера. Если вход блокируется — используйте приложение Gemini через раздел «Приложения».",
      "selectors": {
        "input": "rich-textarea .ql-editor, div.ql-editor[contenteditable=\"true\"]",
        "send": "button.send-button, button[aria-label*=\"Send\"]",
        "response": "model-response",
        "busy": "button[aria-label*=\"Stop\"]",
        "chatLink": "a[href^=\"/app/\"]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "perplexity",
